DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261112T061500
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261112T071500
SUMMARY:W13D4 SWIM | 2700 yd | aerobic consistency
DESCRIPTION:W13D4 — THURSDAY SWIM | 2700 yd | 25-yard pool\nGOAL: Sustain
 able unassisted pace and consistent technique.\n01 | WARM-UP — 400 yd\n4
 00 easy freestyle\, NO equipment.\nRest 30 sec before drills.\n02 | DRILLS
  — 6 x 50 yd = 300 yd\n#1-2: 25 catch-up + 25 easy freestyle\, NO equipm
 ent.\n#3-4: 25 fingertip drag + 25 easy freestyle\, NO equipment.\n#5-6: 2
 5 single-arm focus + 25 easy freestyle\, NO equipment\; keep kicking gentl
 e.\nRest 20 sec after EACH 50\; 45 sec before main set.\n03 | MAIN SET —
  8 x 200 yd = 1600 yd\n#1-4: NO equipment\; steady aerobic RPE 4-5.\n#5: P
 ULL BUOY only\; compare pace and stroke count at same effort.\n#6-8: NO eq
 uipment\; maintain stroke quality\, RPE 4-5.\nRest 25 sec after EACH 200\;
  45 sec before next set.\nDo not force a target pace if technique deterior
 ates.\n04 | FINISH — 4 x 100 yd = 400 yd\n#1-3: NO equipment\; smooth co
 ntrolled aerobic RPE 4-5.\n#4: NO equipment\; easy cooldown RPE 2-3.\nRest
  20 sec after EACH 100.\nTOTAL: 400 + 300 + 1600 + 400 = 2700 yd.\nEQUIPME
 NT: Pull buoy ONLY for main-set 200 #5. NO paddles or fins.\nCALF: Gentle 
 wall push-offs\; no hard kick sets.\nLOG: Splits and strokes for 200s #4\,
  #5 and #6 to compare assisted vs unassisted.
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
